Q.postal_pressure_record =
    "Lewica entertained Gowin's two-year extension of the presidential term";
Q.news_headline =
    "The opposition considers amending the constitution to avoid an election";
!}

His second proposal is the one nobody wants to discuss in public: extend the
president's term by two years, bar him from re-election, and the crisis
disappears. It requires two thirds of the chamber, which means it requires us.

We indicate that we would talk. It is the single most effective thing we can do
to stop the May vote and the single most expensive thing we can do to our own
argument, because for four years we have said that the constitution is not
something you renegotiate when an election is inconvenient. KO says so about us
by the following morning.

- @gowin_resignation

@gowin_resignation
# prose-audit: Grade A — The 6 April resignation is staged as the thing it actually was: a personal exit designed to avoid a party exit, with the coalition, the list and the cabinet seats of Porozumienie explicitly unchanged and the internal three-way split created rather than announced.
title: 6 April — Gowin resigns and Porozumienie does not
subtitle: A personal resignation intended to prevent a party one; the split it opens inside Porozumienie is the lasting consequence
on-arrival: {!
Q.gowin_resigned_2020 = 1;
Q.gowin_in_cabinet = 0;
Q.porozumienie_status =
    "United Right junior partner whose leader has left the cabinet";
Q.united_right_cohesion = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 65) - 6
);
const gowinGroup = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "porozumienie";
});
if (gowinGroup) {
    // The point of the whole scene: one man leaves the government. The party
    // keeps its portfolios, its club and its place on the PiS list.
    gowinGroup.legal_status =
        "allied party whose leader has resigned from the cabinet";
    gowinGroup.cohesion = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.round(Number(Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020) || 58)
    );
    gowinGroup.grievance_memory = Math.min(
        100,
        (Number(gowinGroup.grievance_memory) || 0) + 18
    );
}
// Three tendencies, sized from what the player and PiS have just done. They are
// counted in MPs so that later defections have somewhere to come from.
const cohesion = Math.max(0, Number(Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020) || 58);
const channel = Math.max(0, Number(Q.gowin_channel) || 0);
const standing = Math.max(0, Number(Q.gowin_standing) || 62);
const porozumienieMps = 12;
Q.porozumienie_rebel_mps = Math.max(2, Math.min(
    8,
    Math.round(2 + standing / 22 + channel / 40)
));
Q.porozumienie_loyalist_mps = Math.max(2, Math.min(
    porozumienieMps - Q.porozumienie_rebel_mps - 1,
    Math.round(3 + (70 - Math.min(70, cohesion)) / 8)
));
Q.porozumienie_mediator_mps = Math.max(
    0,
    porozumienieMps - Q.porozumienie_rebel_mps - Q.porozumienie_loyalist_mps
);
const rebels = ["gowin", "sroka", "wypij", "bukowiec", "michalek", "strzezek"];
const loyalists = [
    "bielan", "bortniczuk", "ociepa", "murdzek", "piechowiak",
    "dabrowska_banaszek"
];
for (const record of (Q.rival_person_records || [])) {
    if (record.organisation != "porozumienie") continue;
    if (rebels.includes(record.id)) {
        record.loyalty = "Gowin";
    } else if (loyalists.includes(record.id)) {
        record.loyalty = "United Right first";
    } else {
        record.loyalty = "mediating";
    }
    record.status = "United Right MP";
}
Q.news_headline =
    "Gowin resigns as deputy prime minister; his party stays in government";
!}

= 6 April 2020 — One resignation, no exit

Jarosław Gowin resigns as deputy prime minister and minister of science. He
does not take Porozumienie out of the United Right, does not withdraw its
ministers, does not release its deputies from the coalition agreement, and
recommends **Jadwiga Emilewicz** for the deputy premiership he has just
vacated. Porozumienie remains in the cabinet, in the PiS parliamentary club and
on the PiS electoral list, and will remain there for another sixteen months.

That is the whole design. He has calculated that he can veto Kaczyński only by
threatening the coalition, and that carrying out the threat would destroy his
own party — a party of twelve deputies which exists because it stands on
somebody else's list. So he spends the only thing that is his alone to spend,
which is his office.

What it costs him is not visible today. Inside Porozumienie there are now three
answers to the question of what the party is for. **[+ porozumienie_rebel_mps
+]** deputies think Gowin was right and would follow him further. **[+
porozumienie_loyalist_mps +]** think he has put their seats at risk over a
procedural argument, and have begun taking calls from Nowogrodzka. [? if
porozumienie_mediator_mps = 0: Nobody is left in the middle.?][? if
porozumienie_mediator_mps = 1: One deputy is still trying to hold the two apart.?][? if
porozumienie_mediator_mps > 1: **[+ porozumienie_mediator_mps +]** are still
trying to hold the two apart.?]

- @gowin_read_conservative
- @gowin_read_credit
- @gowin_read_silent

@gowin_read_conservative
# prose-audit: Grade B — Attacking the resignation as theatre is consistent and cheap, and it measurably hardens the pro-PiS wing of Porozumienie against any later cooperation.
title: Call it what it looks like — a resignation that changes nothing
subtitle: Protects our record; the deputies who might have moved toward us stop listening
on-arrival: {!
Q.gowin_channel = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.gowin_channel) || 0) - 12);
Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020 += 4;
Q.psl_relation -= 2;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left calls Gowin's resignation a gesture without a consequence";
!}

We point out that the ministers stayed, the deputies stayed, the list stayed,
and that a man who resigns from a government while keeping his party inside it
has resigned from very little.

It is accurate. It also tells eleven deputies who have just discovered they
disagree with each other that there is nothing on our side of the room worth
walking toward, and the ones who were wavering stop wavering.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@gowin_read_credit
# prose-audit: Grade B — Giving limited public credit is the route that keeps the 2021 options open, and its cost is charged where it belongs: in Lewica's own caucus and in the reproach that we are rehabilitating a former minister of the PiS governments.
title: Give him the narrow credit and no more
subtitle: Keeps a channel open into 2021; our own caucus records the objection
on-arrival: {!
Q.gowin_channel = Math.min(100, (Number(Q.gowin_channel) || 0) + 10);
Q.gowin_standing += 5;
Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020 -= 3;
Q.progressives_dissent += 3;
Q.progressive_credibility -= 2;
Q.psl_relation += 2;
Q.news_headline = "The Left credits Gowin for the resignation and nothing else";
!}

We say that resigning over this was right, that it should have happened three
weeks earlier, and that it does not make him a democrat. The sentence is
constructed so that it can be quoted in full without helping him.

It keeps a line open to people who will matter a great deal in eighteen months,
and it costs us an afternoon of our own deputies asking whether the Left now
issues certificates of good conduct to ministers who spent four years voting
for the courts we are still litigating.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@gowin_read_silent
# prose-audit: Grade B — Saying nothing is a real option with a real effect: it neither builds nor forecloses the 2021 relationship and lets the argument stay inside the right, where it damages the government more.
title: Say nothing and let the right argue with itself
subtitle: No credit, no attack; the story stays a United Right story
on-arrival: {!
Q.united_right_cohesion = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 60) - 3
);
Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020 -= 2;
Q.media_capacity -= 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "The government's crisis is reported without an opposition quotation";
!}

We decline to comment beyond the legal position. For four days the story is
entirely about Kaczyński, Gowin, Emilewicz and the printing works, with no
opposition politician in it to blame.

Our press office hates it. It is also the version in which the United Right's
own deputies do the arguing, and nothing we said gets used to unite them.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@postal_resolution
# prose-audit: Grade A — The May outcome is decided by the resistance the player and Gowin actually assembled and by Gowin's standing inside his own party, not by the date; a forced vote resolves the presidency while the postponement routes feed the later election.
call: poland_normalize
title: What happened to the tenth of May
subtitle: The election that was scheduled does not take place, or does — the count from April decides which
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.postal_resolution_done = 1;
const resistance = Math.max(0, Number(Q.postal_resistance) || 22);
const standing = Math.max(0, Number(Q.gowin_standing) || 62);
const channel = Math.max(0, Number(Q.gowin_channel) || 0);
// Four endings, in the order the political system would reach them.
if (Q.constitutional_bargain_2020 && resistance >= 50 && channel >= 45) {
    Q.postal_outcome = "constitutional";
} else if (resistance >= 44 && standing >= 60) {
    Q.postal_outcome = "clean";
} else if (resistance <= 26 || standing <= 44) {
    Q.postal_outcome = "forced";
} else {
    Q.postal_outcome = "compromise";
}
Q.postal_resolution_coda =
    "The presidential election is now a different campaign from the one " +
    "anybody planned in February, and it is still ours to fight.";
if (Q.postal_outcome == "forced") {
    Q.pres_postal_forced_2020 = 1;
    const postalBoycott = Q.postal_election_stance == "Boycott";
    const postalTurnout = postalBoycott ? 36.4 : 49.8;
    const postalDudaShare = postalBoycott ? 65.2 : 52.4;
    const postalLeftShare = postalBoycott ? 0.7 : 2.6;
    Q.ko_candidate_replacement_2020_done = 1;
    Q.election_event_done = 1;
    Q.reckoning_event_done = 1;
    Q.pres_2020_active = 0;
    Q.pres_2020_phase = "Election complete — disputed postal ballot";
    Q.pres_first_round_complete = 1;
    Q.pres_first_round_majority = 1;
    Q.pres_runoff_complete = 1;
    Q.pres_r1_leader_key = "duda";
    Q.pres_r1_leader_name = "Andrzej Duda";
    Q.pres_finalist_a_key = "duda";
    Q.pres_finalist_a_name = "Andrzej Duda";
    Q.pres_finalist_b_key = "none";
    Q.pres_finalist_b_name = "No runoff";
    Q.pres_r1_turnout = postalTurnout;
    Q.pres_r1_display_duda = postalDudaShare;
    Q.pres_r1_display_left = postalLeftShare;
    Q.pres_runoff_display_a = postalDudaShare;
    Q.pres_runoff_display_b = 0;
    Q.presidential_result = postalLeftShare;
    Q.pres_performance_band = postalLeftShare < 2.5
        ? "Shattering disaster"
        : "Severe defeat";
    Q.pres_performance_level = postalLeftShare < 2.5 ? -3 : -2;
    Q.pres_runoff_winner_key = "duda";
    Q.pres_runoff_winner_name = "Andrzej Duda";
    Q.pres_2020_president_elect_key = "duda";
    Q.pres_2020_president_elect_name = "Andrzej Duda";
    Q.trzaskowski_won = 0;
    Q.left_president = 0;
    Q.postal_resolution_coda =
        "Our campaign ends with " + postalLeftShare + "%. " +
        (postalBoycott
            ? "The boycott is now an electoral defeat as well as a constitutional objection."
            : "Contesting the imposed procedure did not prevent Duda from winning inside it.");
    Q.judicial_legitimacy -= 8;
    Q.public_trust -= 6;
    Q.constitutional_restraint -= 6;
    Q.gowin_standing -= 14;
    Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020 -= 10;
    Q.united_right_cohesion += 4;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Duda is declared re-elected in the forced postal ballot";
} else if (Q.postal_outcome == "clean") {
    Q.judicial_legitimacy += 7;
    Q.constitutional_restraint += 6;
    Q.public_trust += 5;
    Q.gowin_standing += 6;
    Q.united_right_cohesion -= 6;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The May election is postponed by a lawful decision, not an improvisation";
} else if (Q.postal_outcome == "constitutional") {
    Q.judicial_legitimacy -= 3;
    Q.constitutional_restraint -= 6;
    Q.progressive_credibility -= 4;
    Q.gowin_standing += 12;
    Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020 += 6;
    Q.news_headline =
        "The presidential term is extended and the election disappears";
} else {
    Q.judicial_legitimacy -= 4;
    Q.public_trust -= 3;
    Q.gowin_standing += 4;
    Q.united_right_cohesion -= 4;
    Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020 -= 4;
    Q.news_headline =
        "Kaczyński and Gowin agree that the tenth of May will simply not happen";
}
Q.gowin_standing = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, Number(Q.gowin_standing) || 0));
Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020 = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(100, Number(Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020) || 0)
);
!}

= May 2020 — The tenth

[? if postal_outcome = "compromise": On the sixth of May, Jarosław Kaczyński
and Jarosław Gowin issue a joint statement at eleven at night. It says that the
election on the tenth cannot be held, that the Supreme Court will confirm as
much, and that a new date will be set. There is no legal instrument in it. The
packets are already printed; the commissions are never convened; the day simply
passes. Gowin has won and has been given nothing: he stopped the vote, and the
price is a statement co-signed with the man he stopped, which allows Kaczyński
to present the whole affair as a family disagreement settled indoors.?]
[? if postal_outcome = "clean": The resistance in the chamber was large enough
that it could not be counted away, and the postponement is made properly:
announced in advance, grounded in an instrument that exists, and defended by
people who can explain it. The election moves to a date that the electoral
commission sets rather than one the governing party announces. It is the
outcome the constitution was supposed to produce, reached by parliamentary
arithmetic rather than by anybody's good faith.?]
[? if postal_outcome = "forced": There were not enough votes and there was not
enough of Gowin. The postal election proceeds: packets in stairwells, envelopes
in bins and improvised commissions counting a ballot held over opposition
objections. Turnout is **[+ pres_r1_turnout +]%**; Andrzej Duda takes **[+
pres_r1_display_duda +]%** of the envelopes accepted as valid and is declared
re-elected in the first round. The result exists in law, however little trust
exists outside the government. Gowin is left holding an objection that changed
nothing, and inside Porozumienie the deputies who told him it would end this way
are now the ones being listened to. There is no June presidential election.?]
[? if postal_outcome = "constitutional": The amendment is tabled and the
election vanishes with it. **Andrzej Duda** will hold the office for two more
years and may not seek it again, and Poland has resolved a procedural crisis by
editing the constitution — with our votes, which is the part that will be
quoted back at us for the rest of the term. Gowin ends the spring as the man
who found the way out, and it is the strongest he will ever be inside his own
party.?]

[+ postal_resolution_coda +]

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@emilewicz_exit
# prose-audit: Grade A — Emilewicz's September departure demonstrates the affiliation model in a single move: she leaves the party and stays in the club, the list and the cabinet, and the event says so, establishing that PiS can take individuals from Gowin without taking his party.
call: poland_normalize
title: Emilewicz leaves Porozumienie and stays exactly where she was
subtitle: The first proof that PiS can peel deputies off Gowin one at a time
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.emilewicz_left_porozumienie = 1;
Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020 = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020) || 58) - 7
);
Q.gowin_standing = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.gowin_standing) || 62) - 6);
if (!Array.isArray(Q.rival_person_records)) Q.rival_person_records = [];
let emilewicz = Q.rival_person_records.find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "emilewicz";
});
if (!emilewicz) {
    emilewicz = {
        id: "emilewicz", name: "Jadwiga Emilewicz", chamber: "Sejm",
        party: "pis"
    };
    Q.rival_person_records.push(emilewicz);
}
// Party membership changes. Club, list and cabinet do not.
emilewicz.organisation = "pis-aligned independent";
emilewicz.loyalty = "United Right first";
emilewicz.status = "United Right MP outside Porozumienie";
const gowinGroup = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "porozumienie";
});
if (gowinGroup) {
    gowinGroup.cohesion = Math.max(
        0,
        Math.round(Number(Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020) || 51)
    );
    gowinGroup.mp_count = Math.max(0, (Number(gowinGroup.mp_count) || 12) - 1);
    gowinGroup.sejm_mps = gowinGroup.mp_count;
}
Q.news_headline =
    "Emilewicz leaves Gowin's party without leaving his coalition";
!}

= September 2020 — The animal bill takes a deputy prime minister

The fur-farming and ritual-slaughter bill splits the United Right along a line
nobody had drawn before. Solidarna Polska votes against it. Most of
Porozumienie's deputies abstain or vote no, on the straightforward calculation
that their voters keep animals for a living.

**Jadwiga Emilewicz** votes for it. Within days she has left Porozumienie
altogether — and left nothing else. She keeps her seat in the United Right
club, her place on the PiS list and her position in the government. She has
changed her party membership and not one of her political affiliations.

This is the demonstration Kaczyński needed. Gowin's party can be reduced
deputy by deputy without ever formally losing a coalition partner, and the only
number that moves is the one measuring how many people Gowin can still speak
for. Porozumienie's own board describes her departure as a personal decision,
which is the phrase parties use when they cannot afford to say anything else.

- @emilewicz_note_pattern
- @emilewicz_note_ignore

@emilewicz_note_pattern
# prose-audit: Grade B — Naming the mechanism publicly is cheap and its payoff is delayed: it makes the 2021 defections legible to voters instead of arriving as a surprise, at the cost of warning Porozumienie's remaining deputies that we are counting them.
title: Say publicly what the mechanism is
subtitle: Frames every later defection in advance; the deputies concerned now know we are counting them
on-arrival: {!
Q.gowin_channel = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.gowin_channel) || 0) - 4);
Q.porozumienie_defection_named = 1;
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left describes how the United Right absorbs its own partners";
!}

We put the count on the record: how many deputies Porozumienie had in October
2019, how many it has this week, and where each of the missing ones now sits.
It is not a scandal. It is an accounting exercise, and accounting exercises are
what the press uses when the next one leaves.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign

@emilewicz_note_ignore
# prose-audit: Grade B — Treating the defection as internal right-wing business keeps the mediating deputies reachable, which is the resource this chain spends in 2021.
title: Leave it alone as somebody else's problem
subtitle: The wavering Porozumienie deputies stay reachable
on-arrival: {!
Q.gowin_channel = Math.min(100, (Number(Q.gowin_channel) || 0) + 4);
Q.united_right_cohesion = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 58) - 2
);
Q.news_headline =
    "The governing camp loses a deputy prime minister's party membership";
!}

We say nothing beyond the vote itself, which we opposed on drafting grounds and
supported on principle. The deputies inside Porozumienie who have not yet
decided anything are not given a reason to decide against us.

