@gowin_returns
# prose-audit: Grade A — The autumn reconstruction is conditional on Gowin's standing and on how the postal crisis actually ended rather than being scripted, and the route that returns him to the cabinet is the one that sets up the 2021 conflict over Polski Ład and Lex TVN.
call: poland_normalize
title: October 2020 — The United Right is repaired
subtitle: Gowin returns to the cabinet, or does not, and the difference decides how much he has to lose in 2021
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.gowin_return_resolved = 1;
const standing = Math.max(0, Number(Q.gowin_standing) || 50);
const cohesion = Math.max(0, Number(Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020) || 51);
// He returns unless the spring destroyed him inside his own party.
Q.gowin_returned_2020 = (standing >= 46 && cohesion >= 38) ? 1 : 0;
const gowinGroup = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "porozumienie";
});
if (Q.gowin_returned_2020) {
    Q.gowin_in_cabinet = 1;
    Q.gowin_portfolio = "development, labour and technology";
    Q.porozumienie_status =
        "United Right junior partner led by Deputy Prime Minister Gowin";
    Q.united_right_cohesion = Math.min(
        100,
        (Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 55) + 8
    );
    Q.gowin_standing = Math.min(100, standing + 8);
    if (gowinGroup) {
        gowinGroup.in_cabinet = 1;
        gowinGroup.support_mode = "coalition";
        gowinGroup.legal_status = "allied party holding a deputy premiership";
        gowinGroup.relation = Math.max(-100, (Number(gowinGroup.relation) || 22) - 4);
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "Gowin returns as deputy prime minister for development and labour";
} else {
    Q.porozumienie_status =
        "United Right junior partner whose leader holds no office";
    Q.united_right_cohesion = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 55) - 4
    );
    Q.porozumienie_cohesion_2020 = Math.max(0, cohesion - 6);
    if (gowinGroup) {
        gowinGroup.legal_status =
            "allied party excluded from the reconstructed cabinet";
        gowinGroup.grievance_memory = Math.min(
            100,
            (Number(gowinGroup.grievance_memory) || 0) + 20
        );
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "The reconstructed cabinet has no place for Gowin";
}
!}

= October 2020 — Reconstruction

The autumn reconstruction shrinks the cabinet, merges ministries and settles
who survived the spring.

[? if gowin_returned_2020 = 1: Jarosław Gowin comes back as deputy prime
minister with development, labour and technology — a larger portfolio than the
one he resigned, assembled out of three former ministries. It is presented as a
reconciliation and functions as a purchase. He now has something substantial to
lose, which is precisely the condition under which Kaczyński prefers to
negotiate with him. Porozumienie is inside the government again, on the list
again, in the club again; and the deputies who spent April deciding whether
their leader had risked their seats have had no reason to change their minds.?]
[? if gowin_returned_2020 = 0: There is no place in it for Gowin. His party
keeps two junior ministries and its position on the list, and its leader holds
no office at all — a party of the governing coalition led by a man with no
reason to defend the government's record and no salary depending on it.
Nowogrodzka has decided he is not worth buying, which is a cheaper arrangement
and a much less stable one, and everybody in the room knows which of the two
Kaczyński usually prefers.?]

Whatever else the year produced, the United Right ends it intact on paper: one
list, one club, one cabinet, and three parties inside it that no longer agree
about what the arrangement is for.

- @poland_hub: Return to the campaign
